Account-safety / Terms-of-Service notice
-----------------------------------------
The read tools, the T3 send/react tools, and the T4 E2EE DM tools drive a
PERSONAL Facebook account via cookies (unofficial APIs). This is against Meta's
Terms of Service and can get the account actioned or banned. Recommended
posture (same as the social-media skill):

  * Use a WARMED account you can afford to lose, not your primary.
  * Route through ONE static residential/ISP proxy (FB_DM_PROXY), consistent
    with the account's usual geography — never a datacenter IP.
  * Keep a HUMAN cadence and LOW volume; avoid bursts.

The T1 Graph API tools are the ToS-clean path (official tokens, your own
assets) and carry no such risk.
